    "detailed_description": "<h1>PingCity, officially tested on PC</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PingCity, officially tested on PC, join the player group and give us feedback</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At present, the official player group has been opened, and first-hand information will be updated synchronously in the group. Internal testing and other welfare activities will be held, and there is also a chance to participate in the competition and win physical rewards such as JD cards. Welcome to join the discussion together, young heroes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group: 342072404</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game mainly based on the gameplay of magical immortals eating chicken. Here, you will match a suitable lineup in each round, survive until the end, and choose different heroes to experience different gameplay. The game contains 8 types of elemental damage, and different heroes will also match different bond effects, bringing you powerful damage increases.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Support for War\u3011</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can recruit auxiliary characters at any time to form a match with your main battle character and trigger super powerful combination skills.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010 Bonds \u3011</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes have a binding effect on each other, forming a suitable lineup and triggering the binding effect, making battles more profound and nurturing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/9f6572f59e560b2572afd12ada57df0a.poster.avif?t=1729135480\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/9f6572f59e560b2572afd12ada57df0a.webm?t=1729135480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/9f6572f59e560b2572afd12ada57df0a.mp4?t=1729135480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Hide and Seek\u3011</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hide and seek system has been added, allowing you to take on various forms within the scene to evade the pursuit of other players, plot against them, or provide a safe environment for yourself to search for battle heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/aff1210fdea276c262eba55908531d91.poster.avif?t=1729135480\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/aff1210fdea276c262eba55908531d91.webm?t=1729135480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/aff1210fdea276c262eba55908531d91.mp4?t=1729135480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Elemental Reaction\u3011</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 8 types of elemental damage, and all 7 elements except physics can react with each other. Different elemental reactions have different negative effects on the target, which also affects your lineup selection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/9dd24acd30f84c8558d7a51cf5b3679d.poster.avif?t=1729135480\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/9dd24acd30f84c8558d7a51cf5b3679d.webm?t=1729135480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/9dd24acd30f84c8558d7a51cf5b3679d.mp4?t=1729135480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010The Great Demon King\u3011</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can defeat the dragon beasts in the scene to obtain a dragon soul. The dragon soul will transform you into a great demon king, increasing your damage but also causing you to suffer higher damage. At this point, you will become the most prominent one on the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/2d4940694c445868d9e4f3fc5133d055.poster.avif?t=1729135480\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/2d4940694c445868d9e4f3fc5133d055.webm?t=1729135480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/2d4940694c445868d9e4f3fc5133d055.mp4?t=1729135480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Evasion, blocking, floating pursuit, lightness skill\u3011</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat involves diverse ways of behavior, use them flexibly, and become a master of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/9aff1d519f3b60d571435f871433bc07.poster.avif?t=1729135480\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/9aff1d519f3b60d571435f871433bc07.webm?t=1729135480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/9aff1d519f3b60d571435f871433bc07.mp4?t=1729135480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Rich PVE content\u3011</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large amount of PVE content has been completed and will be presented to everyone in the future.</p>",
