ttle heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/aff1210fdea276c262eba55908531d91.poster.avif?t=1729135480\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/aff1210fdea276c262eba55908531d91.webm?t=1729135480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/aff1210fdea276c262eba55908531d91.mp4?t=1729135480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Elemental Reaction\u3011</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 8 types of elemental damage, and all 7 elements except physics can react with each other. Different elemental reactions have different negative effects on the target, which also affects your lineup selection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/9dd24acd30f84c8558d7a51cf5b3679d.poster.avif?t=1729135480\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/9dd24acd30f84c8558d7a51cf5b3679d.webm?t=1729135480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/9dd24acd30f84c8558d7a51cf5b3679d.mp4?t=1729135480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010The Great Demon King\u3011</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can defeat the dragon beasts in the scene to obtain a dragon soul. The dragon soul will transform you into a great demon king, increasing your damage but also causing you to suffer higher damage. At this point, you will become the most prominent one on the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/2d4940694c445868d9e4f3fc5133d055.poster.avif?t=1729135480\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/2d4940694c445868d9e4f3fc5133d055.webm?t=1729135480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/2d4940694c445868d9e4f3fc5133d055.mp4?t=1729135480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Evasion, blocking, floating pursuit, lightness skill\u3011</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat involves diverse ways of behavior, use them flexibly, and become a master of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/9aff1d519f3b60d571435f871433bc07.poster.avif?t=1729135480\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/9aff1d519f3b60d571435f871433bc07.webm?t=1729135480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128530/extras/9aff1d519f3b60d571435f871433bc07.mp4?t=1729135480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Rich PVE content\u3011</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large amount of PVE content has been completed and will be presented to everyone in the future.</p>",
